W("Reference to context: 'Only then did she begin to believe that she was being taken to a place better than her home!' (i) What led her to think so? (ii) What does it say about her treatment at home? (iii) Is her belief right?", 3, "(i) She was bathed, given a clean dress and her matted hair was oiled. (1) (ii) She had never had new clothes; old dresses were passed on and nobody washed or mended them. (1) (iii) Yes, since the school gave her care, education and confidence. (1)", "M"),
