W("Describe how the village changed in the years Bholi was at school.", 3, "The village became a small town. The little primary school became a high school. There were now a cinema under a tin shed and a cotton ginning mill, and the mail train began to stop at their railway station. (3)", "M"),
W("Why did Bholi at first agree to the match, and why did she later reject it?", 3, "She agreed for the sake of her father's izzat (honour); but she rejected it when Bishamber demanded five thousand rupees, humiliating her father and showing greed. She would not be bought. (3)", "M"),
